        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "<em>Analysis:</em> The commentary is consistent with the statutory exclusions for <a href=\"/us/glossary/adaptation-exclusion\">adaptation</a> and duplication of existing business components in §41(d)(4)(B) and (C), but no court decision or IRS publication applying those exclusions to generative AI tools was reviewed here."
