          "If the taxpayer is a member of a <a href=\"/us/glossary/controlled-group\">controlled group of corporations</a> within the meaning of 26 U.S.C. § 41(f)(1)(A) and 26 CFR § 1.41-6, neither the taxpayer nor any other member of the controlled group may have previously claimed a Section 41 research credit on an original or amended return for that credit year (26 CFR § 1.41-9(b)(2), (b)(4))."
