        "text": "On these figures, audit is roughly one-third of revenue at each of the four firms, not one-fifth. Non-audit work (consulting, advisory, tax and other) is about two-thirds, which is a majority but not a \"vast\" one. Tax alone is roughly 17% to 23% of each firm's revenue."
