        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "In accordance with the baseline valuation model, let E_QRE represent the validated <a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-41b1-qualified-research-expenses\">Qualified Research Expenditure</a> base in dollars, r_state represent the applicable state R&D tax credit benefit rate, and d_market represent the secondary market discount rate (incorporating the buyer's price discount and broker transaction fees). The Gross Transferable Credit (C_gross), the Total Transaction Discount/Fee (Fee), and the Net Cash Proceeds to the Seller (C_net) are governed by the following three equations:"
