        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Consider a hypothetical FinTech software firm committing <em>E</em> = $1,000,000 in annual development expenditure across internal developer wages, specialized cryptography contractors, and IaaS/PaaS staging cloud environments. Applying the generalist baseline recovery rate of 8% yields a constant conservative estimate across all complexity tiers:"
