        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "To illustrate the exact mathematical interaction between QREs, the Form 6765 Section D election, and quarterly Form 8974 allocations under post-IRA rules, consider a hypothetical scenario based strictly on the statutory rates, caps, and conservative credit yield assumptions described above."
