        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "In Hypothetical Scenario B, illustrating the U.S. IRS Form 6765 Section G \"80%/Top 50\" rule for a tax year beginning in 2026, consider Hypothetical Software Corp., a non-exempt corporate taxpayer that incurs $2,000,000 in total QREs across 12 distinct business components. Under the 80% itemization rule, the minimum QRE volume that must be itemized by individual business component is:"
