        "text": "Because $1,650,000 (82.5%) exceeds the $1,600,000 (80.0%) statutory threshold and encompasses fewer than 50 business components, the taxpayer must report those 5 business components individually in Section G of Form 6765, while reporting the remaining 7 business components—representing $2,000,000 − $1,650,000 = $350,000, or 17.5% of total QREs—on the single \"Aggregate Business Components\" line."
