        "text": "During its annual filing review, Company A observes three <a href=\"/us/faq/rd-tax-credit-advisor-red-flags\">red-flag behaviors</a>: the incumbent advisor has no engineering staff on its engagement team (w<sub>1</sub> = 20), the advisor conducted zero interviews with Company A's software architects (w<sub>5</sub> = 20), and the advisor's technical narratives consist of generic copy-paste templates (w<sub>3</sub> = 15)."
