      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "<strong>Analysis:</strong> The memorandum, FAQ 21 and Section G all reward records that are organized by business component and <a href=\"/us/glossary/contemporaneous-documentation\">created at the time the research is done</a>. A documentation system that already captures components, activities, personnel, uncertainties and QREs by category can produce both the three items still required at filing and the two items the IRS may request on examination, and it can also populate the Section G component listing now required for tax years beginning after 2025."
      }
