    "summary": "This page explains the IRS Form 6765 instructions for the 2024 tax year, which apply to U.S. taxpayers claiming the research credit under IRC Section 41. The revised form makes Item A, Item B, Section E, and Section F mandatory for 2024, while Section G business component reporting remains optional on original returns through the 2025 tax year.",
    "language": "en-US",
