        "text": "In the official Form 6765 (Rev. December 2024) and its January 2025 Instructions, Line 48 in Section F represents Total Qualified Research Expenses (summarizing Line 42 total qualified wages, Line 43 total supplies, Line 44 total computer rental or lease costs, and Line 47 total contract and basic research expenses), whereas Columns 50, 51, and 52 in Section G represent the three wage subcategories (direct conduct, direct supervision, and direct support, summed in Column 53 Total Qualified Wages), followed by Column 54 (cost of supplies), Column 55 (rental or lease cost of computers), and Column 56 (applicable amount of contract research expenses)."
