        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Consider a hypothetical C corporation (not a member of a controlled group) that incurs $1.2 million of qualified research expenses (QREs) and has $40 million of average annual gross receipts (determined under IRC § 448(c)(3) for the three prior tax years) for its calendar tax year 2026. The corporation is not a Qualified Small Business electing the IRC § 41(h) <a href=\"/us/glossary/payroll-tax-credit-election\">payroll tax credit</a>."
