        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "In an enforcement climate intensified by the Inflation Reduction Act of 2022 (Pub. L. 117-169)—which allocated multi-billion-dollar funding to modernize IRS compliance analytics and hire thousands of additional IRS enforcement agents—and the mandatory rollout of <a href=\"/us/glossary/irs-form-6765\">IRS Form 6765</a> Section G (Business Component Information) for tax years beginning after December 31, 2025, regulatory tolerance for algorithmically generated R&D claims lacking human specialist review has contracted sharply. Whereas Neo.tax and MainStreet prioritize automated startup speed and TaxTrex equips CPAs with structured documentation workflows, a dedicated specialist consultancy functions as a comprehensive risk-transfer mechanism."
