        "text": "This legislative complexity is most acute in the interplay among the <strong>IRC § 41 research credit</strong>, <strong>IRC § 280C(c)</strong>, <strong>Form 6765 Section G</strong>, and the <a href=\"/us/glossary/r-and-e-capitalization\">capitalization</a> or deduction of research or experimental expenditures under <strong>IRC § 174 and § 174A</strong>."
