              "<strong>Tax years beginning after December 31, 2024 (Pub. L. 119-21):</strong> Under <strong><a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-280cc-rd-credit-deduction-disallowance\">26 U.S.C. § 280C(c)(1)</a></strong>, the amount of domestic research expenditures otherwise taken into account under § 174A is reduced by <strong>the full amount of the § 41(a) credit</strong>, unless the taxpayer elects the reduced credit under <strong>§ 280C(c)(2)</strong>.",
