        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Claiming the federal R&D tax credit requires satisfying both the activity qualification standards of <strong>26 U.S.C. § 41(d)</strong> (the Four-Part Test) and the strict expenditure eligibility rules of <strong><a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-41b1-qualified-research-expenses\">26 U.S.C. § 41(b)</a></strong> and <strong>26 CFR § 1.41-2</strong>."
