              "Guidance through IRS audit procedures; substantiating, clarifying and communicating the client's position on exam and at appeals; supports claims filed by Anchin or another provider, first-time claimants, <a href=\"/us/faq/what-happens-if-rd-tax-credit-is-denied\">fully denied claims</a>, contemporaneous-documentation problems and recalculations",
