        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Expense rules under § 41(b), such as the exclusion of land and depreciable property from supplies (<a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-41b2-in-house-research-expenses\">§ 41(b)(2)(C)</a>), are mentioned only in passing because they govern which costs count, not whether an activity passes the four-part test."
