        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "At the operational level, the firm's technical team of engineers, scientists, and technical writers engages directly with client scientific staff. Their workflow encompasses interviewing production, clinical, and engineering personnel; reading scientific journals and internal technical materials to understand product technologies and experimental methods; observing developmental and experimental operations to determine operating procedure details; and translating raw scientific results into <a href=\"/us/faq/how-to-draft-rd-tax-credit-project-narrative\">legislative narratives</a>."
