        "text": "In addition to deducting 100% of any new 2025 domestic R&E costs under Section 174A(a), the taxpayer has three mutually exclusive choices for recovering the $2,100,000 of unamortized 2022–2024 domestic costs (which includes the $900,000 unamortized balance from 2024):"
