              "Provides a dollar-for-dollar credit against tax liability: 20% of QREs over a <a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-41c1-rd-tax-credit-base-amount\">base amount</a> under the regular credit (§ 41(a)(1)) or 14% (or 6% where no prior-three-year QREs exist) under the alternative simplified credit (§ 41(c)(4))."
