          "<strong>Enforce Mandatory Cloud Resource Tagging Policies:</strong> Organizations must implement an automated, mandatory, and standardized resource tagging policy across all AWS, Microsoft Azure, and GCP accounts at the time of instance provisioning. Tags must clearly differentiate cloud resources by activity type—such as Development, Experimentation, Staging, Quality Assurance, and Production—and map those tags directly to internal general ledger cost centers and discrete IRC § 41(d)(2)(B) business components.",
