        "text": "When the JavaScript updateUI() function executes on page load, however, it adds the $200,000 <a href=\"/us/faq/aws-cloud-hosting-costs-rd-tax-credit\">cloud hosting cost</a> to current-year QREs—bringing total current QREs to $1,200,000—and applies a simplified 10 percent multiplier (0.10) rather than the statutory 20 percent marginal multiplier. Under the inconsistent calculation (isConsistent = false), the taxpayer adds $200,000 to current-year QREs but leaves the Base Amount unadjusted at $500,000, yielding an unadjusted incremental excess of $700,000 ($1,200,000 - $500,000), a simulator credit of $70,000 at the 10 percent rate (0.10 × $700,000), and a statutory Regular Credit of $140,000 at the 20 percent rate (0.20 × $700,000)."
