              "Services of a janitor for general cleaning (floor sweeping, trash removal, standard facility upkeep) of a research laboratory or R&D office space.",
              "26 CFR § 1.41-2(c)(3) (lab worker vs. janitor examples): Technical maintenance indispensable to experimental apparatus operation vs. general facility housekeeping."
