        "text": "To prevent legitimate external-facing technological innovation from being disqualified solely because it operates within an enterprise platform that also performs internal G&A functions, 26 CFR § 1.41-4(c)(6)(vi)(B) and (C) establish two sequential relief mechanisms:"
