        "text": "The financial and compliance impact of functional segmentation under 26 CFR § 1.41-4(c)(6)(vi) can be demonstrated through both the official regulatory benchmark in 26 CFR § 1.41-4(c)(6)(viii) Example 14 and an enterprise-scale worked calculation."
