    "summary": "IRC Section 174 governs the federal tax treatment of research and experimental (R&E) expenditures for U.S. businesses. After the TCJA required five-year domestic and 15-year foreign amortization for 2022–2024, the One Big Beautiful Bill Act's new Section 174A restored immediate domestic expensing for tax years beginning after December 31, 2024, while foreign R&E remains amortized over 15 years.",
