        "text": "Because AppDev Corp's $100,000,000 average annual revenue exceeds the $31,000,000 Section 448(c) small business threshold, it is statutorily prohibited from amending its 2022–2024 returns. Instead, AppDev Corp files an automatic accounting method change under Revenue Procedure 2025-28 for the 2025 taxable year (benefiting from the automatic waiver of the five-year prior-change scope limitation) to deduct 100% of its $12,000,000 current 2025 domestic software development spend under Section 174A and elects the one-year accelerated recovery for its $21,000,000 unamortized legacy basis. This generates a combined 2025 federal Section 174A deduction of:"
