              "<a href=\"/us/glossary/substantially-all-rule\">Substantially all</a> (at least 80% under 26 CFR § 1.41-4(a)(6)) of the research activities must constitute elements of a systematic evaluative process assessing one or more alternatives via modeling, simulation, or systematic trial and error.",
