              "<a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-41b2-in-house-research-expenses\">IRC § 41(b)(2)(A)(i)</a>, § 41(b)(2)(B), § 41(b)(2)(D); IRC § 3401(a); 26 CFR § 1.41-2(c)–(d)",
              "Form W-2 Box 1 wages (as defined in IRC § 3401(a)) or self-employed earned income (under IRC § 401(c)(2)) paid or incurred for <a href=\"/us/glossary/qualified-services\">qualified services</a> performed in the U.S. or a U.S. territory: conducting, directly supervising (first-line management), or directly supporting qualified research. If at least 80% (\"<a href=\"/us/faq/substantially-all-rule-rd-tax-credit\">substantially all</a>\") of an employee's services during the tax year constitute qualified services, 100% of that employee's wages qualify (26 CFR § 1.41-2(d)(2)).",
