    "title": "Form 8974",
    "description": "IRS Form 8974 is the quarterly schedule qualified small businesses attach to Form 941, 943 or 944 to apply an elected R&D credit against payroll taxes.",
    "summary": "IRS Form 8974 is the quarterly schedule qualified small businesses attach to Form 941, 943, or 944 to apply an elected federal R&D tax credit against employer payroll taxes. For tax years beginning after December 31, 2022, eligible startups with under $5 million in gross receipts can elect up to $500,000 annually, offsetting Social Security tax first, then Medicare.",
    "language": "en-US",
