              "Production processes are separate business components; rearranging assembly-line work stations or workflow changes driven by management rather than technical experimentation are excluded",
              "Substantiate process-change claims with technical hypotheses, alternatives evaluated, and testing under IRC § 41(d)(1) rather than throughput efficiency studies"
