              "<a href=\"/us/glossary/r-and-e-capitalization\">Mandatory capitalization</a> and ratable amortization over 5 years beginning with the midpoint of the tax year incurred (10% deduction in Year 1).",
              "Mandatory capitalization and ratable amortization over 15 years beginning with the midpoint of the tax year incurred.",
