              "New IRC § 174A (Domestic) & Amended IRC § 174 (Foreign) (Pub. L. 119-21, § 70302)",
              "100% immediate deduction allowed under § 174A(a), OR optional taxpayer election under § 174A(c) to capitalize and amortize over months",
              "Mandatory capitalization and ratable amortization over 15 years (180 months) under § 174(a)(2)(B)",
