              "Expenditures must qualify under <a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-174-research-expenditures-amortization\">IRC § 174</a> / § 174A (Treas. Reg. § 1.174-2), and the activity must intend to develop a new or improved function, performance, reliability, or quality of a business component (product, process, computer software, technique, formula, or invention), excluding style, taste, cosmetic, or seasonal design factors.",
