              "Must pass the 4-Part Test (§ 41(d)): (1) § 174/174A eligibility, (2) technological in nature, (3) new/improved business component, and (4) ≥ 80% process of experimentation (plus heightened <a href=\"/us/glossary/internal-use-software-ius\">internal-use software</a> tests under 26 CFR § 1.41-4(c)(6))."
