              "Narrow: Limited strictly to (1) W-2 wages / self-employed earned income for <a href=\"/us/glossary/qualified-services\">qualified services</a>, (2) tangible non-depreciable supplies, (3) eligible off-premises computer lease/time-sharing costs, and (4) 65% (or 75%/100%) of eligible domestic contract research (§ 41(b)). Excludes overhead, travel, fringe benefits, and depreciation."
