              "Excluded from QREs: Patent procurement legal expenses do not qualify as QREs (IRS § 41 Audit Techniques Guide), though issuance of a utility patent under 35 U.S.C. § 151 triggers the \"<a href=\"/us/glossary/patent-safe-harbor\">patent safe harbor</a>\" (26 CFR § 1.41-4(a)(3)(iii)) for technological discovery."
