        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The statutory timeline governing when a QSB can begin reducing its cash FICA deposits is anchored strictly to the actual filing date of its income tax return. Under IRC § 3111(f)(1), Notice 2017-23, Section 4.06, and the Instructions for Form 8974, the payroll tax credit becomes available starting in the first calendar quarter that begins after the date on which the taxpayer files its income tax return making the election on Form 6765."
