              "<strong>Taxpayer lost (65% of COO wages disallowed; $68,263 and $141,945 deficiencies):</strong> Lack of contemporaneous task-based documentation of hands-on experimentation or first-line R&D supervision resulted in 100% disallowance of claimed executive wages."
