        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Despite the enactment of Section 174A for domestic expenses, the TCJA capitalization rules remain vital for ongoing federal audits, unrecovered basis tracking, foreign research amortization, and state tax compliance in decoupled jurisdictions that have not adopted the OBBBA amendments."
