        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "In <em>George v. Commissioner</em>, T.C. Memo. 2026-10 (Feb. 3, 2026), Judge Greaves evaluated amended 2012–2014 tax returns claiming $4.47 million in research tax credits filed by shareholders of George's of Missouri, Inc. (GOMI), an S corporation operating the live-production side of a <a href=\"/us/faq/agricultural-rd-tax-credits-for-farmers\">vertically integrated poultry producer</a> that engaged alliantgroup in 2014 to conduct a retroactive R&D study across seven research trial categories. The Tax Court established three major holdings directly governing supply QREs and credit computations under IRC § 41(b)(1):"
