        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Finally, in Step 7, TechNova multiplies the $800,000 of creditable excess QREs by the 20 percent statutory credit rate under Section 41(a)(1), yielding a final gross federal Regular Research Credit of $160,000 (prior to any <a href=\"/us/legislation/26-usc-280cc-rd-credit-deduction-disallowance\">IRC § 280C(c)</a> reduced credit election)."
