        "text": "Because 95.0% ≥ 80%, the Backend Encryption Algorithm Module satisfies the \"substantially all\" threshold under 26 U.S.C. § 41(d)(1)(C) and 26 C.F.R. § 1.41-4(a)(6), allowing the firm to isolate and substantiate the qualifying experimental wages tied to the encryption module."
